# 🚀 Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/Valerix-Lung-Cancer-Detection.git

cd Valerix-Lung-Cancer-Detection
```

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install tensorflow
pip install opencv-python
pip install numpy
pip install pandas
pip install scikit-learn
pip install matplotlib
```

Or

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# ▶️ Running the Project

```bash
python valerix_lung_cancer_detection.py
```

The system will automatically:

1. Generate CT scan data
2. Preprocess images
3. Train ValerixNet
4. Evaluate model performance
5. Generate visual reports
6. Display diagnostic analytics

