# 🌟 Why This Project Matters

Healthcare professionals often analyze hundreds of medical scans daily.

This project demonstrates how Artificial Intelligence can:

- Assist radiologists
- Improve diagnostic efficiency
- Reduce analysis time
- Support early detection
- Enable scalable healthcare solutions

While this implementation serves educational and research purposes, it showcases the real-world potential of AI in medical diagnostics.

